{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05559","headline":"铜雀妓 · 李邕","name":"铜雀妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西陵望何及，弦管徒在兹。\n谁言死者乐，但令生者悲。\n丈夫有余志，儿女焉足私。\n扰扰多俗情，投迹互相师。\n直节岂感激，荒淫乃凄其。\n颍水有许由，西山有伯夷。\n颂声何寥寥，唯闻铜雀诗。\n君举良未易，永爲後代嗤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}